<title>USA: Ector County Hospital, Texas, yields 5.25 pct.</title>
<headline>Ector County Hospital, Texas, yields 5.25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Securities Inc said it tentatively priced $24.245 million of Ector County Hospital District, Texas, hospital revenue refunding bonds, series 1997, with a top yield of 5.25 percent in 2006.</p>
</text>
